nd="00:19.360">back </span><span begin="00:19.360" end="00:19.784">to </span><span begin="00:19.784" end="00:20.128">him</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.684" end="00:26.480"><span begin="00:20.684" end="00:21.277">Chewing </span><span begin="00:21.277" end="00:21.629">on </span><span begin="00:21.629" end="00:21.901">her </span><span begin="00:21.901" end="00:22.339">nails </span><span begin="00:22.339" end="00:22.572">and </span><span begin="00:22.572" end="00:22.947">her </span><span begin="00:22.947" end="00:23.386">pens </span><span begin="00:23.882" end="00:24.235">while </span><span begin="00:24.235" end="00:24.499">she's </span><span begin="00:24.499" end="00:25.091">dreaming </span><span begin="00:25.091" end="00:25.530">of </span><span begin="00:25.530" end="00:25.891">him</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.480" end="00:28.717"><span begin="00:26.480" end="00:26.788">And </span><span begin="00:26.788" end="00:27.010">he's </span><span begin="00:27.010" end="00:27.687">f**king </span><span begin="00:27.687" end="00:28.012">in </span><span begin="00:28.012" end="00:28.467">sin</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.717" end="00:30.111"><span begin="00:28.717" end="00:28.917">You </span><span begin="00:28.917" end="00:29.165">know </span><span begin="00:29.165" end="00:29.462">he </span><span begin="00:29.462" end="00:29.733">is</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.111" end="00:32.710"><span begin="00:30.111" end="00:30.301">She </span><span begin="00:30.301" end="00:30.520">said </span><span begin="00:30.520" end="00:30.539">it's </span><span begin="00:30.539" end="00:30.730">for </span><span begin="00:30.730" end="00:31.035">all </span><span begin="00:31.215" end="00:31.371">the </span><span begin="00:31.371" end="00:31.740">right </span><span begin="00:32.005" end="00:32.525">reasons</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.710" end="00:35.731"><span begin="00:32.710" end="00:33.404">Baby </span><span begin="00:33.404" end="00:33.632">don't </span><span begin="00:33.632" end="00:33.789">care </span><span begin="00:33.789" end="00:34.011">'bout </span><span begin="00:34.011" end="00:34.376">grades </span><span begin="00:34.376" end="00:34.635">just </span><span begin="00:34.635" end="00:34.899">call </span><span begin="00:34.899" end="00:35.054">me </span><span begin="00:35.054" end="00:35.292">your </span><span begin="00:35.292" end="00:35.731">lady</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.731" end="00:39.760"><span begin="00:35.731" end="00:35.875">If </span><span begin="00:35.875" end="00:36.091">I </span><span begin="00:36.091" end="00:36.283">pass </span><span begin="00:36.283" end="00:36.516">this </span><span begin="00:36.516" end="00:36.708">quiz </span><span begin="00:36.708" end="00:36.907">will </span><span begin="00:36.907" end="00:37.147">you </span><span begin="00:37.147" end="00:37.355">give </span><span begin="00:37.355" end="00:37.581">me </span><span begin="00:37.581" end="00:37.804">your </span><span begin="00:37.804" end="00:38.428">babies</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.760" end="00:40.761"><span begin="00:39.760" end="00:39.948">Don't </span><span begin="00:39.948" end="00:40.180">call </span><span begin="00:40.180" end="00:40.396">me </span><span begin="00:40.396" end="00:40.761">crazy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.761" end="00:43.572"><span begin="00:40.761" end="00:40.997">You </span><span begin="00:40.997" end="00:41.448">love </span><span begin="00:41.448" end="00:41.696">me </span><span begin="00:41.696" end="00:42.047">but </span><span begin="00:42.047" end="00:42.288">you </span><span begin="00:42.288" end="00:42.752">won't </span><span begin="00:42.752" end="00:42.944">come </span><span begin="00:42.944" end="00:43.425">save </span><span begin="00:43.425" end="00:43.572">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.572" end="00:46.142"><span begin="00:43.572" end="00:43.780">You </span><span begin="00:43.780" end="00:43.966">got </span><span begin="00:43.966" end="00:44.180">a </span><span begin="00:44.180" end="00:44.412">wife </span><span begin="00:44.412" end="00:44.628">and </span><span begin="00:44.628" end="00:44.835">kids </span><span begin="00:44.835" end="00:45.064">you </span><span begin="00:45.064" end="00:45.260">see </span><span begin="00:45.260" end="00:45.502">them </span><span begin="00:45.502" end="00:45.963">daily</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.142" end="00:51.345"><span begin="00:46.142" end="00:46.316">Don't </span><span begin="00:46.316" end="00:46.501">know </span><span begin="00:46.501" end="00:46.737">why </span><span begin="00:47.233" end="00:47.528">you </span><span begin="00:47.674" end="00:48.025">even </span><span begin="00:48.025" end="00:48.449">need </span><span begin="00:48.449" end="00:48.625">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.345" end="00:54.416"><span begin="00:51.345" end="00:52.528">Teacher's </span><span begin="00:52.528" end="00:53.216">pet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.416" end="00:59.483"><span begin="00:54.416" end="00:54.560">If </span><span begin="00:54.560" end="00:54.728">I'm </span><span begin="00:54.728" end="00:55.034">so </span><span begin="00:55.034" end="00:55.649">special </span><span begin="00:55.649" end="00:56.068">why </span><span begin="00:56.068" end="00:56.506">am </span><span begin="00:56.506" end="00:56.883">I </span><span begin="00:57.051" end="00:58.285">secret</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.483" end="01:01.338"><span begin="00:59.483" end="00:59.627">Yeah </span><span begin="00:59.627" end="00:59.835">why </span><span begin="00:59.835" end="01:00.003">the </span><span begin="01:00.003" end="01:00.320">f**k </span><span begin="01:00.320" end="01:00.525">is </span><span begin="01:00.525" end="01:00.994">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.338" end="01:09.679"><span begin="01:01.338" end="01:01.490">Do </span><span begin="01:01.490" end="01:02.083">you </span><span begin="01:02.083" end="01:03.498">regret </span><span begin="01:04.588" end="01:04.746">the </span><span begin="01:04.746" end="01:04.930">things </span><span begin="01:04.930" end="01:05.122">we </span><span begin="01:05.122" end="01:05.554">shared </span><span begin="01:05.554" end="01:05.836">that </span><span begin="01:05.836" end="01:06.231">I'll </span><span begin="01:06.431" end="01:07.047">never </span><span begin="01:07.047" end="01:08.455">forget</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.679" end="01:12.043"><span begin="01:09.679" end="01:09.835">Well </span><span begin="01:09.835" end="01:09.994">do </span><span begin="01:09.994" end="01:10.144">you </span><span begin="01:10.144" end="01:10.525">tell </span><span begin="01:10.525" end="01:10.955">me </span><span begin="01:11.123" end="01:11.555">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.043" end="01:17.107"><span begin="01:12.043" end="01:12.250">I </span><span begin="01:12.250" end="01:12.475">know </span><span begin="01:12.475" end="01:12.716">I'm </span><span begin="01:12.716" end="01:13.272">young </span><span begin="01:13.576" end="01:13.774">but </span><span begin="01:14.051" end="01:14.216">my </span><span begin="01:14.216" end="01:14.645">mind </span><span begin="01:14.645" end="01:14.872">is </span><span begin="01:14.872" end="01:15.272">well </span><span begin="01:15.272" end="01:15.800">beyond </span><span begin="01:15.800" end="01:16.095">my </span><span begin="01:16.271" end="01:16.679">years</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.107" end="01:21.949"><span begin="01:17.107" end="01:17.311">I </span><span begin="01:17.311" end="01:17.615">knew </span><span begin="01:17.615" end="01:17.751">this </span><span begin="01:17.751" end="01:18.511">wouldn't </span><span begin="01:18.511" end="01:18.754">last </span><span begin="01:19.121" end="01:19.326">but </span><span begin="01:19.326" end="01:19.630">f**k </span><span begin="01:19.630" end="01:19.888">you </span><span begin="01:19.888" end="01:20.374">don't </span><span begin="01:20.374" end="01:20.607">you </span><span begin="01:20.607" end="01:20.966">leave </span><span begin="01:20.966" end="01:21.222">me </span><span begin="01:21.222" end="01:21.747">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.949" end="01:25.025"><span begin="01:21.949" end="01:23.154">Teacher's </span><span begin="01:23.154" end="01:24.816">pet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.025" end="01:31.919"><span begin="01:25.025" end="01:25.189">If </span><span begin="01:25.189" end="01:25.369">I'm </span><span begin="01:25.369" end="01:25.610">so </span><span begin="01:25.610" end="01:26.288">special </span><span begin="01:26.288" end="01:26.703">why </span><span begin="01:26.703" end="01:27.031">am </span><span begin="01:27.031" end="01:27.398">I </span><span begin="01:27.623" end="01:28.839">secret</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.919" end="01:35.804"><span begin="01:31.919" end="01:32.087">She's </span><span begin="01:32.087" end="01:32.687">feeling </span><span begin="01:32.687" end="01:33.007">like </span><span begin="01:33.007" end="01:33.310">a </span><span begin="01:33.310" end="01:34.015">spider </span><span begin="01:34.015" end="01:34.338">in </span><span begin="01:34.338" end="01:34.828">a </span><span begin="01:35.140" end="01:35.621">cage</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.804" end="01:39.507"><span begin="01:35.804" end="01:35.960">You </span><span begin="01:35.960" end="01:36.564">liar </span><span begin="01:36.564" end="01:36.849">you </span><span begin="01:36.849" end="01:37.387">were </span><span begin="01:37.580" end="01:38.087">her </span><span begin="01:38.251" end="01:39.236">desire</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.507" end="01:42.149"><span begin="01:39.507" end="01:39.716">Now </span><span begin="01:39.716" end="01:39.875">she </span><span begin="01:39.875" end="01:40.044">wants </span><span begin="01:40.044" end="01:40.227">to </span><span begin="01:40.227" end="01:40.452">light </span><span begin="01:40.452" end="01:40.644">you </span><span begin="01:40.644" end="01:40.843">on </span><span begin="01:41.031" end="01:41.596">fire</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.149" end="01:45.468"><span begin="01:42.149" end="01:42.332">But </span><span begin="01:42.332" end="01:42.670">f**k </span><span begin="01:42.670" end="01:42.940">it </span><span begin="01:42.940" end="01:43.284">she'll </span><span begin="01:43.284" end="01:43.561">still </span><span begin="01:43.561" end="01:43.892">give </span><span begin="01:43.892" end="01:44.252">you </span><span begin="01:44.252" end="01:44.621">a </span><span begin="01:44.621" end="01:45.201">call</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.468" end="01:49.269"><span begin="01:45.468" end="01:45.812">And </span><span begin="01:45.812" end="01:46.092">a </span><span begin="01:46.092" end="01:46.764">lighter </span><span begin="01:46.764" end="01:47.220">when </span><span begin="01:47.220" end="01:47.716">you </span><span begin="01:47.876" end="01:48.226">wanna </span><span begin="01:48.477" end="01:48.749">get </span><span begin="01:48.749" end="01:49.269">high</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.269" end="01:51.687"><span begin="01:49.269" end="01:49.547">And </span><span begin="01:50.090" end="01:50.282">mess </span><span begin="01:50.282" end="01:50.586">around </span><span begin="01:50.586" end="01:50.770">'til </span><span begin="01:50.770" end="01:50.994">you </span><span begin="01:50.994" end="01:51.235">get </span><span begin="01:51.235" end="01:51.687">numb</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.687" end="01:54.539"><span begin="01:51.687" end="01:51.904">She </span><span begin="01:51.904" end="01:52.136">said </span><span begin="01:52.136" end="01:52.327">it's </span><span begin="01:52.327" end="01:52.543">for </span><span begin="01:52.543" end="01:52.960">all </span><span begin="01:52.960" end="01:53.184">the </span><span begin="01:53.184" end="01:53.464">right </span><span begin="01:53.785" end="01:54.400">reasons</sp